{
  "id": "single_phase_power_equations",
  "title": "Single Phase Power Equations",
  "description": "Power equations for single phased electrical systems. Calculate real power, total power, and brake horsepower.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Single Phase Power Equations\n\nPower equations for single phased electrical systems.\n\n## Real Power\n\nWapplied = U × I × PF / 1000\n\nwhere:\n- Wapplied = real power (kilowatts, kW)\n- U = voltage (volts, V)\n- I = current (amps, A)\n- PF = power factor (0.7 - 1.0)\n\n## Total Power\n\nW = U × I / 1000\n\nwhere:\n- W = total power (kilowatts, kW)\n- U = voltage (volts, V)\n- I = current (amps, A)\n\n## Brake Horsepower\n\nWBHP = U × I × PF × μ / 746\n\nwhere:\n- WBHP = brake horsepower (hp)\n- U = voltage (volts, V)\n- I = current (amps, A)\n- PF = power factor (0.7 - 1.0)\n- μ = device efficiency (0 - 1.0)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "voltage",
          "label": "Voltage (U)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "V",
          "defaultValue": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "current",
          "label": "Current (I)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "A",
          "defaultValue": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "power_factor",
          "label": "Power Factor (PF)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "efficiency",
          "label": "Efficiency (μ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "",
          "defaultValue": 0.96
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "real_power",
          "label": "Real Power (Wapplied)",
          "formula": "inputs.voltage * inputs.current * inputs.power_factor / 1000",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_power",
          "label": "Total Power (W)",
          "formula": "inputs.voltage * inputs.current / 1000",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "brake_horsepower",
          "label": "Brake Horsepower (WBHP)",
          "formula": "inputs.voltage * inputs.current * inputs.power_factor * inputs.efficiency / 746",
          "unit": "hp",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Symbol",
        "Unit",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Voltage",
